  "details": "Click the notifications button in the top bar of VRChat Home website on a PC until you receive the following message:\n\n> Mail never arrives early nor late, but precisely when its sender means it to.\n\nThe notification box should then either be either fully visible, or the maximum width for text should be changed so that the width of the notifications dropdown box doesn't extend past the left edge of the browser viewport.\n\nCurrently it extends to left past the viewport (see attached screenshot).\n\n```\n\nMicrosoft Edge 144.0.3719.115 (Official build) (64-bit) \n\nRevision 4ee501a4f64e61182fd7c660df020a8c7e59655a\n\nChromium version 144.0.7559.133\n\nOperating system Windows 11 Version 25H2 (Build 26200.7705)\n\nJavaScript V8 14.4.24.9\n\nUser agent Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0\n\nCommand-line \"C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft\\Edge\\Application\\msedge.exe\" --flag-switches-begin --flag-switches-end --single-argument https://github.com/bdunderscore/modular-avatar/releases/tag/1.16.1\n\n```\n\nDisplay/window resolution: 2560x1440",
